  npcName: Physician
  foodRequestProbability: 0.65
  medicineRequestProbability: 0.35
  reRequestChance: 0.5
  foodRequestLines:
  - I haven't the strength to treat anyone. A meal please.
  medicineRequestLines:
  - My pulse feels strained. A prepared remedy would be wise.
  foodAcceptLines:
  - Thank you. Proper nourishment will help me tend to others.
  medicineAcceptLines:
  - Thank you. This dose will keep my condition balanced.
  foodRejectLines:
  - Very well. But understand that fatigue dulls a healer's hand.
  medicineRejectLines:
  - Then I will proceed cautiously with what strength remains.
  foodReRequestLines:
  - Please...
  medicineReRequestLines:
  - Please...
  foodReAcceptLines:
  - Good. Even a belated meal will restore my focus.
  medicineReAcceptLines:
  - I'm relieved you agreed. The remedy will steady my pulse.
  foodReRejectLines:
  - I suppose I must endure. Such is the body's test.
  medicineReRejectLines:
  - Then I shall rely on my own regimen.
